---
source: crates/psptool-cli/tests/help.rs
expression: "render_help(&[\"list\", \"--help\"])"
---
List directories and entries

Usage: psptool list [OPTIONS] <FILE>

Arguments:
  <FILE>  Firmware image

Options:
  -r, --rom-index <ROM_INDEX>  ROM index [default: 0]
  -j, --json                   JSON output
  -n, --no-duplicates          Iterate unique entries only
  -t, --key-tree               Print the cert-tree key tree
  -m, --metrics                Print parsing metrics
  -v, --verbose                Verbose columns
      --sparse                 Render the upstream-exact SPARSE `-v` columns: an empty `flags` cell and a 4-char uppercase `MD5` (`psptool.py:179`/`:180`). The default output is richer (populated `flags` + full 32-char MD5). Also enabled by setting the `PSPTOOL_LS_SPARSE` env var to `1`/`true`
  -h, --help                   Print help
